<!--
	A battlefield of the Conquest event (ConquestMapData). Written by the Conquest map page (//conquest): edits by hand are kept, comments are not.
	map      id (the file name), name (shown to the players), enabled (the event picks one of the enabled maps by chance), maxPlayers (per team)
	area     the battlefield, minX/minY (north-west corner) to maxX/maxY (south-east corner); z: the ground's height, where it has several layers
	team     blue or red, with its spawn points: x, y, z, heading, radius (how far around the point a wave is spread)
	capture  a capture point: name (A, B...), x, y, z, radius (how close a player must stand to capture it)
	door     a door of data/Doors.xml the event opens (open="true") or closes (open="false") when it starts; doors not named are left as they are
-->
<map id="pagan_temple" name="Pagan Temple" enabled="true" maxPlayers="100">
	<description>Rune, underground. Halls, corridors and doors, mirrored west/east around the sanctuary. Each team spawns in the four outer rooms of its wing; its home points are the wing's corner rooms (A/B west, F/G east). Down the middle: C in the sanctuary hall, which the wings reach only through its eight corridor doors; D in the pillared nave past the sanctuary gates; E before the altar. The middle rooms of each wing and the side rooms along the nave and altar are left empty, to hide and flank. The event opens the corridor doors, the sanctuary gates and the altar's secret side doors, and shuts the temple gate (the way out to the surface) and the gates to the inner altar.</description>
